  "description": "College student Yeong-Jun has always found his neighbor, the cheerful fruit store owner Seong-Ho, a bit too overbearing. But when a sudden downpour traps them both under the narrow eaves of Yeong-Jun's house, the air between them turns heavy. As the rain soaks through Seong-Ho’s thin white shirt, it reveals a secret that leaves Yeong-Jun breathless. Clinging to Seong-Ho’s broad, muscular chest is the unmistakable silhouette of a delicate lace garment. Now that he’s seen what lies beneath the friendly neighbor’s exterior, Yeong-Jun can never look at the man or his fruit the same way again.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
